      {
        "line": 5,
        "text": "Use `moss-coreml-int8`. Across two complete order-reversed runs it preserved"
      },
      {
        "line": 6,
        "text": "the same aggregate English WER as FP16, reduced pooled RTF by about 11%, and"
      },
      {
        "line": 11,
        "text": "- Machine: Apple M5 Pro, 48 GB"
      },
      {
        "line": 14,
        "text": "- Dataset: 80 English FLEURS clips from the speech-bench-data Hugging Face"
      },
      {
        "line": 15,
        "text": "  fixture"
      },
      {
        "line": 30,
        "text": "| Variant | Aggregate WER | CER | Pooled RTF | Pooled \u00d7RT | Peak RSS range |"
      },
      {
        "line": 31,
        "text": "|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|"
      },
      {
        "line": 32,
        "text": "| CoreML INT8 | 8.16% | 5.90% | **0.070** | **14.3\u00d7** | **2,382\u20132,399 MB** |"
      },
      {
        "line": 33,
        "text": "| CoreML FP16 | 8.16% | 5.90% | 0.079 | 12.6\u00d7 | 3,689\u20133,735 MB |"
      },
      {
        "line": 35,
        "text": "INT8 has an 11.4% lower pooled RTF. Comparing the observed peak ranges, it"
      },
      {
        "line": 40,
        "text": "| Order | Variant | Mean RTF | Median RTF | Overall \u00d7RT | Peak RSS |"
      },
      {
        "line": 41,
        "text": "|---|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|"
      },
      {
        "line": 42,
        "text": "| Run 1, first | INT8 | 0.064 | 0.060 | 16.4\u00d7 | 2,399 MB |"
      },
      {
        "line": 43,
        "text": "| Run 1, second | FP16 | 0.088 | 0.079 | 11.8\u00d7 | 3,735 MB |"
      },
      {
        "line": 44,
        "text": "| Run 2, first | FP16 | 0.076 | 0.074 | 13.6\u00d7 | 3,689 MB |"
      },
      {
        "line": 45,
        "text": "| Run 2, second | INT8 | 0.080 | 0.070 | 12.7\u00d7 | 2,382 MB |"
      },
      {
        "line": 73,
        "text": "Convert the HF `metadata.jsonl` fixture to the TSV form accepted by"
      },
      {
